 Several lines of work relate to Tokalator's scope.




%% LITERATURE: Consider citing the OpenAI Cookbook article "How to count tokens with
%% tiktoken" (openai.com/cookbook) as a practitioner reference alongside the sennrich2016bpe
%% foundational paper — it documents the practical per-model encoding differences (cl100k,
